{"reviews":[{"id":"B06WWL6NLH-0","r":2.0,"t":"Just disappointed.","x":"I really wish the colors were the same as the listing. I did not receive any medium blue or light blue elastic. One third of the elastic colors were neon which I'm not going to use. There were a lot of browns. The quality seems all right. Just disappointed.","h":31,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2017"},{"id":"B06WWL6NLH-1","r":5.0,"t":"Mudder was great!","x":"The elastics were exactly what I expected, once I got them. Strangely enough, a package full of Chinese finger traps showed up instead and amazon wouldn\u2019t let me return it. I emailed Mudder directly and they didn\u2019t know what happened but sent me a replacement pack right away. They returned the email the same night I sent it, I was really pleased with how they handled it :)","h":16,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2018"},{"id":"B06WWL6NLH-2","r":4.0,"t":"Good product","x":"Used to make headbands and to attach bows/flowers. Good amount and good selection of colors. It will fray when cut in half and did fray a small amout when making a tutu but you wont find the quantity and variety for this price anywhere else.","h":13,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B06WWL6NLH-3","r":5.0,"t":"Great product!","x":"I love this elastic!! It\u2019s soft and great quality. I love how one side is shiny. It\u2019s worth the money!","h":12,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B06WWL6NLH-4","r":5.0,"t":"Soft elastic for delicate use only.","x":"I like these because they are very soft.  They are best used for very,  very,  light weight,  use.  Not sturdy elastic.  I needed elastic to hold my iPad (corner tabs) in a holder I was sewing up.  They are too soft and they are foldable.. I later read more about the different types of elastics and uses...  This one is best for lightweight,  delicate applications like lingerie or camis.  It is good product for the right application.  Great to keep in your stash...I know I will use it on somethin","h":10,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B06WWL6NLH-5","r":1.0,"t":"Color selection is great, quantity - not so much","x":"Color selection is great, quantity - not so much!  Almost of these colors measured less than a yard!!!! I am guessing they stretched it out to measure and sell you a stretched out yard!","h":10,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2018"},{"id":"B06WWL6NLH-6","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"The selection is good but they only measured 34 1/2 to 35 inches. I would still purchase again.","h":9,"v":1,"d":"May 2018"},{"id":"B06WWL6NLH-7","r":4.0,"t":"Excellent Colors but too short to make a pair of panties","x":"We make panties and leotards mostly and this is not quite enough in each piece to finish a whole pair of panties (leg holes and waist). They are gorgeous colors though! The variety and quality are wonderful. But, it would be nice to get about twice as much of each color.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B06WWL6NLH-8","r":1.0,"t":"Not a yard","x":"Great variety of colors but NONE of the elastic was a yard long.  I'm making bands to donate to a children's hospital and need the pieces to be a yard each. I already started cutting when I figured it out so I can't return it.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B06WWL6NLH-9","r":5.0,"t":"Saves me tons of money to DIY","x":"My daughter doesnt have much hair and I was about to go broke on all the headbands and decided to try this. I can put pretty much anything and hot glue it to this headband! So cheap !","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B06WWL6NLH-10","r":1.0,"t":"Not even close to 1 yard each","x":"1 yard each? Try 1/2 yard!! Seriously, some of these measure so far under one yard it\u2019s a joke. You get what you pay for I guess.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B06WWL6NLH-11","r":5.0,"t":"Great quality and assortment of  colors","x":"Perfect assortment of colors. I'm using the elastics for my daughter's birthday, we're making hair ties for favors. I was able to cut about 4 per color (8 ish inches each).","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B06WWL6NLH-12","r":2.0,"t":"Quality is a little lacking","x":"The price is good but the elastic snags doesn't hold it's snap and recovery very well. The variety of colors is good though.  I give it a two because it is of lesser quality. If i were doing headbands or hair ties, I would not recommend this product because of the quality. For sewing, purposes I have used it and it works fine.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B06WWL6NLH-13","r":5.0,"t":"Beautiful Colors and Many Uses","x":"I have yet to use these. Bought these elastic ribbons to make barefoot sandals for my newborn granddaughter. The colors are so pretty and bright, I can't wait to see them on her little feet.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2018"},{"id":"B06WWL6NLH-14","r":5.0,"t":"As Expected","x":"Soft and nice.  Exactly what I had expected.  Nice color assortment too. The picture accurately reflects what I received.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B06WWL6NLH-15","r":5.0,"t":"Use these to make hairbands. I can get 4 ...","x":"Use these to make hairbands. I can get 4 out of each piece of ribbon. Much cheaper than buying these pre-made.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"May 2017"},{"id":"B06WWL6NLH-16","r":3.0,"t":"Inaccurate size description","x":"Not all of the pieces of elastic are 36\" (1yard) as advertised. My first piece was 32\", and I counted on having a yard of each color for mask ties. Buyer Beware!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B06WWL6NLH-17","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect nice and soft!","x":"Perfect made baby headbands for friends grand daughters.Very soft and nice colors to choose from.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B06WWL6NLH-18","r":5.0,"t":"Excellent for making COVID19 masks","x":"I was looking for stretchy bands to make DIY COVID19 masks.  After reading many descriptions and reviews, I choose these bands.  They were not exactly what I was looking for, they were even BETTER.  The function is perfect for the masks, but with the variety  of colors, I can make really flashy (if I'm in the mood for that) or even plain looking (sometimes I'm a bit socially anxious) masks.  But most importantly, the functionality is perfect!  Exceeded my expectations.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2020"},{"id":"B06WWL6NLH-19","r":5.0,"t":"Made 3 ties a color, good quality","x":"We use these to make hair ties.  We got about 3 per color so that was a good deal!  The thickness is fine and they\u2019ll last a while.  I wasn\u2019t thrilled with all the colors, but since I\u2019m using them for girl ponytails not all colors have to be perfect.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2018"},{"id":"B06WWL6NLH-20","r":5.0,"t":"so I was so happy to find these for such a great price on ...","x":"We don't have a lot of stores in our area for buying sewing or craft supplies, so I was so happy to find these for such a great price on Amazon. There's a lot of elastic and colors for the price, and I will definitely buy again.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2018"},{"id":"B06WWL6NLH-21","r":1.0,"t":"Not a full yard of each color","x":"Each color was to be a yard. However, each color was anywhere from 1 to 2 inches short of a full yard. While an inch or two doesn't seem like much when you consider 32 yards of elastic, it adds up to a good deal of shortage.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B06WWL6NLH-22","r":5.0,"t":"Ribbon Elastic","x":"Really nice varity of colors.  Packaged nice, and shipped fast. Looking forward to the use of this item. Would order again.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2017"},{"id":"B06WWL6NLH-23","r":5.0,"t":"Great","x":"Met and exceeded my expectations! I love these ribbon especially because they don't snag in my little girl's hair. Thanks","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2017"},{"id":"B06WWL6NLH-24","r":5.0,"t":"Beautiful Colors!!!","x":"I loved the colors! They are strong & vibrant! The product is just like described. Pictures are with & without flash.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise the wide variety and attractive assortment of colors.","cites":[3,6,8,12,14,15]},{"text":"Many reviewers report the elastic pieces are shorter than the advertised one yard.","cites":[6,7,9,11]},{"text":"Several reviewers describe the elastic as soft and good quality.","cites":[4,5,15]},{"text":"Some reviewers find the elastic too soft or of lesser quality for sturdier uses.","cites":[5,13]},{"text":"A few reviewers note the elastic frays when cut.","cites":[3]}]},"qa":[]}